{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 168406, "game_id": 1069, "entry_id": 111542, "uid": 87565, "type": 4, "title": "乱斗介绍", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1664593947, "updated_at": 1665713914, "updated_uid": 92835, "comment_at": 1676011338, "last_at": 1682338648, "comment_count": 2, "status": 1, "summary": "前言老样子一、乱斗是什么二、我为什么要参与乱斗三、怎么玩好乱斗一、乱斗是什么1、乱斗是一种常驻玩法，为15V15与其他玩家阵容对抗且你方不可以手动操作（只能全自动打）2022年9月更新可以设置技能预约", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_573/h_556/1069/87565/2022/9/1/662395.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_578/h_606/1069/87565/2022/9/1/87967.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_596/h_693/1069/87565/2022/9/1/625201.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 2, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 15436, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 3, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 168406, "content": "<div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">前言</span></div></div><div><br></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"\">老样子</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">一、乱斗是什么&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;二、我为什么要参与乱斗&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;三、怎么玩好乱斗</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\"></div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">一、乱斗是什么</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span></div></div><br></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\">1、乱斗是一种常驻玩法，为15V15<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\">与其他玩家阵容对抗且你方不可以手动操作（只能全自动打）</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2022年9月更新可以设置技能预约，基本解决了天子智商（出招）问题。<span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">（防守时依然无智商）</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\">2、战场上每次出现5名3行天子，前面的天子退场，后面同一列的天子会顶上。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\">3、与常驻PVP不同的还有，乱斗分为4种：限制本源3星、本源4星及以下、无限制、双重乱斗(活动)</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container active-item\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">参与位置与技能设置位置展示</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"573\" data-height=\"556\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_573/h_556/1069/87565/2022/9/1/662395.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_573/h_556/1069/87565/2022/9/1/662395.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"578\" data-height=\"606\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_578/h_606/1069/87565/2022/9/1/87967.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_578/h_606/1069/87565/2022/9/1/87967.png\"></div><img data-width=\"83\" data-height=\"305\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_83/h_305/1069/87565/2022/9/1/739013.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_83/h_305/1069/87565/2022/9/1/739013.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"388\" data-height=\"104\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_388/h_104/1069/87565/2022/9/1/337513.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_388/h_104/1069/87565/2022/9/1/337513.png\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></div></div>\n                               </div><br><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,182,79);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;text-align:left;\">二、</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,182,79);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,182,79);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;text-align:left;\">我为什么要参与乱斗</span></div></div><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"></div></span><div style=\"text-align: left;\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\"></div></span><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\">1、说实话乱斗奖励真没PVP的好，虽然有常驻三种但一般人加一块还不一定能有PVP得的多，且PVP有商店和奖杯店，乱斗没有。</div><div style=\"text-align: left;\">2、钻石，附魔石，装备券，血石（前一百）别做梦了乱斗前一百那你得是饼干佬和他的佬伙伴。</div><div style=\"text-align: left;\">3、<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">参与就有奖励干嘛不打</span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">祝各位早日超越Blue佬小子</div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"></div></span><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">奖励预览三个一样</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"596\" data-height=\"693\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_596/h_693/1069/87565/2022/9/1/625201.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_596/h_693/1069/87565/2022/9/1/625201.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"603\" data-height=\"733\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_603/h_733/1069/87565/2022/9/1/815716.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_603/h_733/1069/87565/2022/9/1/815716.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"615\" data-height=\"332\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_615/h_332/1069/87565/2022/9/1/855154.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_615/h_332/1069/87565/2022/9/1/855154.png\"></div><br></div></div>\n                               </div><br><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,182,79);font-size:24px;font-weight:700;text-align:left;\">三、</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,182,79);font-size:24px;font-weight:700;text-align:left;\"></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,182,79);font-size:24px;font-weight:700;text-align:left;\">怎么玩好乱斗</span></div></div><br></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"></div></span><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\">1、由于乱斗的人数较多，时间较长相对PVP能开出FT。所以会针对这个机制配队伍，不死BUFF在这里变得常见。</div><div style=\"text-align: left;\">2、我乱斗排名不高站内暂时没有权威乱斗贴，3/4的乱斗因为不出新天子所以阵容都是固定的，照着排行榜耍，基本不会有什么问题。</div><div style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;5星乱斗会因为天子的更新改变阵容，但不少天子在PVP和地狱、星云也能用所以练过，所以也不是门槛高的离谱。</div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\">3、新人还是重在参与，中期可以学习参考排行榜的配置阵容，后期装备条件和理解上来了自然也能拿到不错的成绩。</div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\">4、等待乱斗大佬和他的攻略出现</div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\">5、可以参考一些PVP的强化</div></span></span><div style=\"text-align: left;\"></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div></span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_573/h_556/1069/87565/2022/9/1/662395.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_578/h_606/1069/87565/2022/9/1/87967.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_596/h_693/1069/87565/2022/9/1/625201.png"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 87565, "username": "纠结37", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/11.png", "description": "DC混了一年半，好好玩半年，又要开始混了。", "follow_num": 141, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "不忘初心", "tag_color": "#FEC700"}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 5, "content_at": 87603334, "content_num": 27, "read_num": 1273844, "like_